{"id": "85933", "name": "חיבור וקטורים בהצגת i, j, k (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "texp", "params": ["x"], "body": "if numberp(x) and x<0 then concat(\"\\\\left(\",tex1(x),\"\\\\right)\") else tex1(x)"}, {"name": "texmul", "params": ["e"], "body": "simplode(map(texp, args(e)), \" \\\\cdot \")"}, {"name": "texsumf", "params": ["e"], "body": "block([L:first(args(e))], concat(tex1(first(L)), apply(sconcat, map(lambda([t], concat(\"+\",texp(t))), rest(L)))))"}, {"name": "texnsum", "params": ["e"], "body": "block([L:first(args(e))], concat(tex1(first(L)), apply(sconcat, map(lambda([t], if numberp(t) and t<0 then concat(\"-\",tex1(-t)) else concat(\"+\",tex1(t))), rest(L)))))"}, {"name": "texsq", "params": ["e"], "body": "concat(texp(first(args(e))), \"^2\")"}, {"name": "texpar", "params": ["e"], "body": "texp(first(args(e)))"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Given that \\(\\mathbf{a} = {{CT:0}}\\,\\mathbf{i} + {{CT:1}}\\,\\mathbf{j} + {{CT:2}}\\,\\mathbf{k}\\) and that \\(\\mathbf{b} = {{CT:3}}\\,\\mathbf{i} + {{CT:4}}\\,\\mathbf{j} + {{CT:5}}\\,\\mathbf{k}\\)</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">then \\(\\mathbf{a}+\\mathbf{b}=\\) [[input:ans1]] \\(\\mathbf{i}\\) \\(+\\) [[input:ans2]] \\(\\mathbf{j}\\) \\(+\\) [[input:ans3]] \\(\\mathbf{k}\\).</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]] [[validation:ans2]] [[validation:ans3]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Adding the vectors</b><br>Vectors are added component by component: the coefficients of \\(\\mathbf{i}\\), \\(\\mathbf{j}\\) and \\(\\mathbf{k}\\) are added separately. With<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbf{a} = {{CT:0}}\\,\\mathbf{i} + {{CT:1}}\\,\\mathbf{j} + {{CT:2}}\\,\\mathbf{k},\\qquad \\mathbf{b} = {{CT:3}}\\,\\mathbf{i} + {{CT:4}}\\,\\mathbf{j} + {{CT:5}}\\,\\mathbf{k} \\]</p>we get<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\begin{aligned} \\mathbf{a}+\\mathbf{b} &= \\left({{CT:6}}\\right)\\mathbf{i}+\\left({{CT:7}}\\right)\\mathbf{j}+\\left({{CT:8}}\\right)\\mathbf{k} \\\\ &= {{CT:9}}\\,\\mathbf{i} + {{CT:10}}\\,\\mathbf{j} + {{CT:11}}\\,\\mathbf{k}. \\end{aligned} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:r]]", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "+", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "+", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "+", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "r", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "r_answer:[ans1,ans2,ans3];\n a_minus_b:[a_x - b_x,a_y - b_y,a_z - b_z];\n b_minus_a:[b_x - a_x,b_y - a_y,b_z - a_z];", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "CasEqual", "sans": "r_answer", "tans": "r", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "VEC-ADD-TRUE ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "VEC-ADD-FALSE", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "CasEqual", "sans": "r_answer", "tans": "a_minus_b", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "A_MINUS_B", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">Your answer is \\(\\mathbf{a} - \\mathbf{b}\\).</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "VEC-ADD-FALSE-1 ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "CasEqual", "sans": "r_answer", "tans": "b_minus_a", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "B_MINUS_A", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">Your answer is \\(\\mathbf{b} - \\mathbf{a}\\).</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "VEC-ADD-FALSE-2", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["a_x", "a_x_magnitude", "a_x_plus_b_x", "a_x_sign", "a_y", "a_y_magnitude", "a_y_plus_b_y", "a_y_sign", "a_z", "a_z_magnitude", "a_z_plus_b_z", "a_z_sign", "b_x", "b_x_magnitude", "b_x_sign", "b_y", "b_y_magnitude", "b_y_sign", "b_z", "b_z_magnitude", "b_z_sign", "r"], "nvariants": 50}